      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "RESCRIPt is a python 3 package to support a variety of operations for managing and curating reference sequence databases, DNA/RNA sequence data, and taxonomic data. See citation information below for a full benchmark and description."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 2,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Install via QIIME 2."
